<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<PLUGIN name="header-fix" author="EllipticSet" version="2026.10.25.1800" pluginURL="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EllipticSet/unraid-header-fix/main/plugin/header-fix.plg" support="https://github.com/EllipticSet/unraid-header-fix/issues" min="7.1.0" icon="fa-wrench">
  <CHANGES>
###2026.10.25.1800
- The plugin file now contains the package, so installation and updates no longer download it from GitHub.
- Add Community Applications metadata for the EllipticSet fork.

###2026.10.24.1600
- Fix the logo link on Unraid 7.4.0-rc.2, whose header does not use the uh-logo class.
- Rewrite only the unraid.net home link in the header logo; other unraid.net links are left unchanged.

###2026.10.24.0000
- Support the unified Unraid 7.4 header, including the placeholder shown before it loads.
- The plugin is now maintained at https://github.com/EllipticSet/unraid-header-fix.

###2026.10.18.0000
- End of support for the original plugin by Derek Kaser.

###2026.03.19.2240
- Fix the name format on the Plugins page.

###2026.01.07.02
- Add a link to the support thread.
</CHANGES>
